# Comma-separated IPs/CIDRs of reverse proxies whose X-Forwarded-For is trusted (empty = trust none)
# The trusted proxy must set/append X-Forwarded-For (nginx: proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;) or clients can spoof their IP.
# TRUSTED_PROXIES=
